{"id": "ru-6785d1199739.de", "jokeId": "ru-6785d1199739", "locale": "de", "adaptation": "direct", "notes": "Line-by-line translation, no narrator; 'спирт' as Alkohol so the drunk's grief reads at once (Brennspiritus would not be drinkable). The new specimen shelf with the frog jars stands at the back left of the museum; the drunk stands at it, his friend with glasses in front.", "title": "Drei Frösche", "location": "zal", "cast": ["muzhik", "muzhik-ryzhy"], "roles": {"muzhik": "drunk", "muzhik-ryzhy": "everyman"}, "lines": [{"character": "muzhik", "text": "Mir blutet einfach das Herz, wenn ich diese in Alkohol eingelegten Tiere sehe!", "emotion": "sad", "pauseAfterSec": 0}, {"character": "muzhik-ryzhy", "text": "Ach was, da sind doch nur drei Frösche drin...", "emotion": "surprised", "pauseAfterSec": 0}, {"character": "muzhik", "text": "Eben. Drei Frösche. Und Alkohol — so um die zehn Liter!!", "emotion": "angry", "pauseAfterSec": 0, "laugh": "big"}], "scenes": [{"location": "zal", "place": "museum", "cast": ["muzhik", "muzhik-ryzhy"], "roles": {"muzhik": "drunk", "muzhik-ryzhy": "everyman"}, "looks": {"muzhik-ryzhy": {"add": ["glasses"]}}, "set": [{"item": "specimen-shelf", "at": "specimen-shelf"}], "beats": [{"type": "move", "who": "muzhik", "to": "landscape"}, {"type": "move", "who": "muzhik-ryzhy", "to": "front-center"}, {"type": "act", "who": "muzhik", "act": "cry"}, {"type": "line", "ref": "l1"}, {"type": "act", "who": "muzhik-ryzhy", "act": "shrug"}, {"type": "line", "ref": "l2"}, {"type": "act", "who": "muzhik", "act": "point"}, {"type": "line", "ref": "l3"}]}]}
{"id": "ru-36aacd8e2aa5.ru", "jokeId": "ru-36aacd8e2aa5", "locale": "ru", "adaptation": "original", "notes": "Text kept as written; numbers as words, 'НР' read out as 'новый русский', the typo '300 000 тысяч' fixed to 'триста тысяч'. Three rich men on the bathhouse bench in towels and felt bath hats, with gold chains; the caller picks the phone up off the bench, holds it to his ear through all three calls and puts it back on the bench before asking whose it is.", "title": "Чей телефон?", "location": "banya", "cast": ["muzhik", "nachalnik", "muzhik-sosed"], "roles": {"muzhik": "new-russian", "nachalnik": "new-russian", "muzhik-sosed": "new-russian"}, "lines": [{"character": "narrator", "text": "Сидят несколько новых русских в бане.", "emotion": "neutral", "pauseAfterSec": 0}, {"character": "narrator", "text": "Звонит сотовик.", "emotion": "neutral", "pauseAfterSec": 0}, {"character": "narrator", "text": "Один из них берёт трубку:", "emotion": "neutral", "pauseAfterSec": 0}, {"character": "nachalnik", "text": "Алё... да, дорогая... да, в бане... да, с друганами... да. До одиннадцати.", "emotion": "neutral", "pauseAfterSec": 0}, {"character": "nachalnik", "text": "Что купить? Платье?? Тысяча долларов? Зачем тебе пятидесятое платье?", "emotion": "surprised", "pauseAfterSec": 0}, {"character": "nachalnik", "text": "В театр сходить? Ну ладно. Деньги знаешь где? Купи.", "emotion": "smug", "pauseAfterSec": 0}, {"character": "narrator", "text": "Опять звонок, тот же новый русский берёт трубку:", "emotion": "neutral", "pauseAfterSec": 0}, {"character": "nachalnik", "text": "Алё... да, дорогая... да, в бане... да, с друганами... да. До одиннадцати.", "emotion": "neutral", "pauseAfterSec": 0}, {"character": "nachalnik", "text": "Что купить? Шубу?? Зачем тебе десятая шуба??", "emotion": "surprised", "pauseAfterSec": 0}, {"character": "nachalnik", "text": "На Канары съездить? Пятьдесят тысяч?? Ну ладно... Деньги знаешь где...", "emotion": "smug", "pauseAfterSec": 0}, {"character": "narrator", "text": "Опять звонок, опять тот же новый русский:", "emotion": "neutral", "pauseAfterSec": 0}, {"character": "nachalnik", "text": "Алё... да, дорогая... да, в бане... да, с друганами... да. До одиннадцати.", "emotion": "neutral", "pauseAfterSec": 0}, {"character": "nachalnik", "text": "Что купить? Машину??? Зачем тебе шестая машина???", "emotion": "angry", "pauseAfterSec": 0}, {"character": "nachalnik", "text": "Перед мамой выпендриться? Сколько??? Триста тысяч гринов??? Ну ладно... Покупай... Деньги знаешь где...", "emotion": "smug", "pauseAfterSec": 0}, {"character": "narrator", "text": "Отключает трубку...", "emotion": "neutral", "pauseAfterSec": 0}, {"character": "nachalnik", "text": "Гм... кхем... мужики, чей телефон?", "emotion": "surprised", "pauseAfterSec": 0, "laugh": "big"}], "scenes": [{"location": "banya", "cast": ["muzhik", "nachalnik", "muzhik-sosed"], "roles": {"muzhik": "new-russian", "nachalnik": "new-russian", "muzhik-sosed": "new-russian"}, "looks": {"nachalnik": {"clothes": "#e6b48c", "add": ["towel-wrap", "bath-hat"], "remove": ["suit", "tie"]}, "muzhik": {"clothes": "#efc8a0", "add": ["gold-chain", "towel-wrap", "bath-hat"], "remove": ["flat-cap"]}, "muzhik-sosed": {"clothes": "#e6b48c", "add": ["gold-chain", "towel-wrap", "bath-hat"]}}, "beats": [{"type": "move", "who": "muzhik", "to": "bench-1"}, {"type": "move", "who": "nachalnik", "to": "bench-2"}, {"type": "move", "who": "muzhik-sosed", "to": "bench-3"}, {"type": "prop", "who": "muzhik", "item": "glass", "action": "hold"}, {"type": "prop", "who": "muzhik-sosed", "item": "bottle", "action": "hold"}, {"type": "act", "who": "muzhik", "act": "drink"}, {"type": "line", "ref": "l1"}, {"type": "act", "who": "muzhik-sosed", "act": "look-down"}, {"type": "act", "who": "muzhik", "act": "look-down"}, {"type": "line", "ref": "l2"}, {"type": "prop", "who": "nachalnik", "item": "phone", "action": "hold"}, {"type": "act", "who": "nachalnik", "act": "phone"}, {"type": "line", "ref": "l3"}, {"type": "line", "ref": "l4"}, {"type": "act", "who": "nachalnik", "act": "shake-head"}, {"type": "line", "ref": "l5"}, {"type": "act", "who": "nachalnik", "act": "nod"}, {"type": "line", "ref": "l6"}, {"type": "act", "who": "muzhik-sosed", "act": "drink"}, {"type": "line", "ref": "l7"}, {"type": "line", "ref": "l8"}, {"type": "act", "who": "nachalnik", "act": "shake-head"}, {"type": "line", "ref": "l9"}, {"type": "act", "who": "nachalnik", "act": "nod"}, {"type": "line", "ref": "l10"}, {"type": "act", "who": "muzhik", "act": "drink"}, {"type": "line", "ref": "l11"}, {"type": "line", "ref": "l12"}, {"type": "act", "who": "nachalnik", "act": "shake-head"}, {"type": "line", "ref": "l13"}, {"type": "act", "who": "nachalnik", "act": "nod"}, {"type": "line", "ref": "l14"}, {"type": "prop", "who": "nachalnik", "item": "phone", "action": "put"}, {"type": "act", "who": "nachalnik", "act": "think"}, {"type": "line", "ref": "l15"}, {"type": "act", "who": "nachalnik", "act": "point"}, {"type": "act", "who": "muzhik", "act": "scratch-head"}, {"type": "line", "ref": "l16"}]}]}
{"id": "ru-36aacd8e2aa5.en", "jokeId": "ru-36aacd8e2aa5", "locale": "en", "adaptation": "direct", "notes": "Line-by-line translation; per adaptNote the New Russians are just rich guys, the setting stays the sauna. Numbers as words, 'greens' as bucks, the typo '300 000 thousand' read as three hundred thousand. Staging as in the Russian: towels, bath hats, gold chains; the phone is picked up off the bench and put back before the punchline.", "title": "Whose Phone?", "location": "banya", "cast": ["muzhik", "nachalnik", "muzhik-sosed"], "roles": {"muzhik": "new-russian", "nachalnik": "new-russian", "muzhik-sosed": "new-russian"}, "lines": [{"character": "narrator", "text": "A few rich guys are sitting in a sauna.", "emotion": "neutral", "pauseAfterSec": 0}, {"character": "narrator", "text": "A cell phone rings.", "emotion": "neutral", "pauseAfterSec": 0}, {"character": "narrator", "text": "One of them picks it up:", "emotion": "neutral", "pauseAfterSec": 0}, {"character": "nachalnik", "text": "Hello... yes, darling... yes, in the sauna... yes, with the guys... yes. Till eleven.", "emotion": "neutral", "pauseAfterSec": 0}, {"character": "nachalnik", "text": "Buy what? A dress?? A thousand dollars? What do you need a fiftieth dress for?", "emotion": "surprised", "pauseAfterSec": 0}, {"character": "nachalnik", "text": "To go to the theatre? Well, all right. You know where the money is? Buy it.", "emotion": "smug", "pauseAfterSec": 0}, {"character": "narrator", "text": "Another call, the same rich guy picks it up:", "emotion": "neutral", "pauseAfterSec": 0}, {"character": "nachalnik", "text": "Hello... yes, darling... yes, in the sauna... yes, with the guys... yes. Till eleven.", "emotion": "neutral", "pauseAfterSec": 0}, {"character": "nachalnik", "text": "Buy what? A fur coat?? What do you need a tenth fur coat for??", "emotion": "surprised", "pauseAfterSec": 0}, {"character": "nachalnik", "text": "A trip to the Canaries? Fifty thousand?? Well, all right... you know where the money is...", "emotion": "smug", "pauseAfterSec": 0}, {"character": "narrator", "text": "Another call, the same rich guy again:", "emotion": "neutral", "pauseAfterSec": 0}, {"character": "nachalnik", "text": "Hello... yes, darling... yes, in the sauna... yes, with the guys... yes. Till eleven.", "emotion": "neutral", "pauseAfterSec": 0}, {"character": "nachalnik", "text": "Buy what? A car??? What do you need a sixth car for???", "emotion": "angry", "pauseAfterSec": 0}, {"character": "nachalnik", "text": "To show off in front of your mom? How much??? Three hundred thousand bucks??? Well, all right... buy it... you know where the money is...", "emotion": "smug", "pauseAfterSec": 0}, {"character": "narrator", "text": "He hangs up...", "emotion": "neutral", "pauseAfterSec": 0}, {"character": "nachalnik", "text": "Hmm... ahem... guys, whose phone is this?", "emotion": "surprised", "pauseAfterSec": 0, "laugh": "big"}], "scenes": [{"location": "banya", "cast": ["muzhik", "nachalnik", "muzhik-sosed"], "roles": {"muzhik": "new-russian", "nachalnik": "new-russian", "muzhik-sosed": "new-russian"}, "looks": {"nachalnik": {"clothes": "#e6b48c", "add": ["towel-wrap", "bath-hat"], "remove": ["suit", "tie"]}, "muzhik": {"clothes": "#efc8a0", "add": ["gold-chain", "towel-wrap", "bath-hat"], "remove": ["flat-cap"]}, "muzhik-sosed": {"clothes": "#e6b48c", "add": ["gold-chain", "towel-wrap", "bath-hat"]}}, "beats": [{"type": "move", "who": "muzhik", "to": "bench-1"}, {"type": "move", "who": "nachalnik", "to": "bench-2"}, {"type": "move", "who": "muzhik-sosed", "to": "bench-3"}, {"type": "prop", "who": "muzhik", "item": "glass", "action": "hold"}, {"type": "prop", "who": "muzhik-sosed", "item": "bottle", "action": "hold"}, {"type": "act", "who": "muzhik", "act": "drink"}, {"type": "line", "ref": "l1"}, {"type": "act", "who": "muzhik-sosed", "act": "look-down"}, {"type": "act", "who": "muzhik", "act": "look-down"}, {"type": "line", "ref": "l2"}, {"type": "prop", "who": "nachalnik", "item": "phone", "action": "hold"}, {"type": "act", "who": "nachalnik", "act": "phone"}, {"type": "line", "ref": "l3"}, {"type": "line", "ref": "l4"}, {"type": "act", "who": "nachalnik", "act": "shake-head"}, {"type": "line", "ref": "l5"}, {"type": "act", "who": "nachalnik", "act": "nod"}, {"type": "line", "ref": "l6"}, {"type": "act", "who": "muzhik-sosed", "act": "drink"}, {"type": "line", "ref": "l7"}, {"type": "line", "ref": "l8"}, {"type": "act", "who": "nachalnik", "act": "shake-head"}, {"type": "line", "ref": "l9"}, {"type": "act", "who": "nachalnik", "act": "nod"}, {"type": "line", "ref": "l10"}, {"type": "act", "who": "muzhik", "act": "drink"}, {"type": "line", "ref": "l11"}, {"type": "line", "ref": "l12"}, {"type": "act", "who": "nachalnik", "act": "shake-head"}, {"type": "line", "ref": "l13"}, {"type": "act", "who": "nachalnik", "act": "nod"}, {"type": "line", "ref": "l14"}, {"type": "prop", "who": "nachalnik", "item": "phone", "action": "put"}, {"type": "act", "who": "nachalnik", "act": "think"}, {"type": "line", "ref": "l15"}, {"type": "act", "who": "nachalnik", "act": "point"}, {"type": "act", "who": "muzhik", "act": "scratch-head"}, {"type": "line", "ref": "l16"}]}]}
{"id": "ru-36aacd8e2aa5.de", "jokeId": "ru-36aacd8e2aa5", "locale": "de", "adaptation": "direct", "notes": "Line-by-line translation; per adaptNote the New Russians are just rich guys, the setting stays the sauna. Dollars and 'greens' as euros, numbers as words, the typo '300 000 thousand' read as three hundred thousand. Staging as in the Russian: towels, bath hats, gold chains; the phone is picked up off the bench and put back before the punchline.", "title": "Wessen Handy?", "location": "banya", "cast": ["muzhik", "nachalnik", "muzhik-sosed"], "roles": {"muzhik": "new-russian", "nachalnik": "new-russian", "muzhik-sosed": "new-russian"}, "lines": [{"character": "narrator", "text": "Ein paar reiche Typen sitzen in der Sauna.", "emotion": "neutral", "pauseAfterSec": 0}, {"character": "narrator", "text": "Ein Handy klingelt.", "emotion": "neutral", "pauseAfterSec": 0}, {"character": "narrator", "text": "Einer von ihnen geht ran:", "emotion": "neutral", "pauseAfterSec": 0}, {"character": "nachalnik", "text": "Hallo... ja, Schatz... ja, in der Sauna... ja, mit den Jungs... ja. Bis elf.", "emotion": "neutral", "pauseAfterSec": 0}, {"character": "nachalnik", "text": "Was kaufen? Ein Kleid?? Tausend Euro? Wozu brauchst du ein fünfzigstes Kleid?", "emotion": "surprised", "pauseAfterSec": 0}, {"character": "nachalnik", "text": "Ins Theater gehen? Na gut. Du weißt, wo das Geld ist? Kauf es.", "emotion": "smug", "pauseAfterSec": 0}, {"character": "narrator", "text": "Wieder ein Anruf, derselbe reiche Typ geht ran:", "emotion": "neutral", "pauseAfterSec": 0}, {"character": "nachalnik", "text": "Hallo... ja, Schatz... ja, in der Sauna... ja, mit den Jungs... ja. Bis elf.", "emotion": "neutral", "pauseAfterSec": 0}, {"character": "nachalnik", "text": "Was kaufen? Einen Pelzmantel?? Wozu brauchst du einen zehnten Pelzmantel??", "emotion": "surprised", "pauseAfterSec": 0}, {"character": "nachalnik", "text": "Auf die Kanaren fliegen? Fünfzigtausend?? Na gut... du weißt, wo das Geld ist...", "emotion": "smug", "pauseAfterSec": 0}, {"character": "narrator", "text": "Wieder ein Anruf, wieder derselbe reiche Typ:", "emotion": "neutral", "pauseAfterSec": 0}, {"character": "nachalnik", "text": "Hallo... ja, Schatz... ja, in der Sauna... ja, mit den Jungs... ja. Bis elf.", "emotion": "neutral", "pauseAfterSec": 0}, {"character": "nachalnik", "text": "Was kaufen? Ein Auto??? Wozu brauchst du ein sechstes Auto???", "emotion": "angry", "pauseAfterSec": 0}, {"character": "nachalnik", "text": "Vor deiner Mama angeben? Wie viel??? Dreihunderttausend Euro??? Na gut... kauf's... du weißt, wo das Geld ist...", "emotion": "smug", "pauseAfterSec": 0}, {"character": "narrator", "text": "Er legt auf...", "emotion": "neutral", "pauseAfterSec": 0}, {"character": "nachalnik", "text": "Hm... ähem... Jungs, wessen Handy ist das?", "emotion": "surprised", "pauseAfterSec": 0, "laugh": "big"}], "scenes": [{"location": "banya", "cast": ["muzhik", "nachalnik", "muzhik-sosed"], "roles": {"muzhik": "new-russian", "nachalnik": "new-russian", "muzhik-sosed": "new-russian"}, "looks": {"nachalnik": {"clothes": "#e6b48c", "add": ["towel-wrap", "bath-hat"], "remove": ["suit", "tie"]}, "muzhik": {"clothes": "#efc8a0", "add": ["gold-chain", "towel-wrap", "bath-hat"], "remove": ["flat-cap"]}, "muzhik-sosed": {"clothes": "#e6b48c", "add": ["gold-chain", "towel-wrap", "bath-hat"]}}, "beats": [{"type": "move", "who": "muzhik", "to": "bench-1"}, {"type": "move", "who": "nachalnik", "to": "bench-2"}, {"type": "move", "who": "muzhik-sosed", "to": "bench-3"}, {"type": "prop", "who": "muzhik", "item": "glass", "action": "hold"}, {"type": "prop", "who": "muzhik-sosed", "item": "bottle", "action": "hold"}, {"type": "act", "who": "muzhik", "act": "drink"}, {"type": "line", "ref": "l1"}, {"type": "act", "who": "muzhik-sosed", "act": "look-down"}, {"type": "act", "who": "muzhik", "act": "look-down"}, {"type": "line", "ref": "l2"}, {"type": "prop", "who": "nachalnik", "item": "phone", "action": "hold"}, {"type": "act", "who": "nachalnik", "act": "phone"}, {"type": "line", "ref": "l3"}, {"type": "line", "ref": "l4"}, {"type": "act", "who": "nachalnik", "act": "shake-head"}, {"type": "line", "ref": "l5"}, {"type": "act", "who": "nachalnik", "act": "nod"}, {"type": "line", "ref": "l6"}, {"type": "act", "who": "muzhik-sosed", "act": "drink"}, {"type": "line", "ref": "l7"}, {"type": "line", "ref": "l8"}, {"type": "act", "who": "nachalnik", "act": "shake-head"}, {"type": "line", "ref": "l9"}, {"type": "act", "who": "nachalnik", "act": "nod"}, {"type": "line", "ref": "l10"}, {"type": "act", "who": "muzhik", "act": "drink"}, {"type": "line", "ref": "l11"}, {"type": "line", "ref": "l12"}, {"type": "act", "who": "nachalnik", "act": "shake-head"}, {"type": "line", "ref": "l13"}, {"type": "act", "who": "nachalnik", "act": "nod"}, {"type": "line", "ref": "l14"}, {"type": "prop", "who": "nachalnik", "item": "phone", "action": "put"}, {"type": "act", "who": "nachalnik", "act": "think"}, {"type": "line", "ref": "l15"}, {"type": "act", "who": "nachalnik", "act": "point"}, {"type": "act", "who": "muzhik", "act": "scratch-head"}, {"type": "line", "ref": "l16"}]}]}
{"id": "ru-9b3a6cdc152e.ru", "jokeId": "ru-9b3a6cdc152e", "locale": "ru", "adaptation": "original", "notes": "Text kept as written, the judge's speech split into the sentence and the question, number as words. The judge in his robe bangs the new gavel on the sentence and points at the defendant on the question; the defendant sits in the dock and gets up for his answer.", "title": "Штраф", "location": "sud", "cast": ["muzhik", "nachalnik"], "roles": {"muzhik": "everyman", "nachalnik": "judge"}, "lines": [{"character": "nachalnik", "text": "Я приговариваю вас к пятистам рублям денежного штрафа за оскорбление государственного служащего.", "emotion": "angry", "pauseAfterSec": 0}, {"character": "nachalnik", "text": "Хотели бы вы что-нибудь сказать на это, обвиняемый?", "emotion": "smug", "pauseAfterSec": 0}, {"character": "muzhik", "text": "Вообще-то хотел бы! Но при таких ценах...", "emotion": "sad", "pauseAfterSec": 0, "laugh": "big"}], "scenes": [{"location": "sud", "cast": ["muzhik", "nachalnik"], "roles": {"muzhik": "everyman", "nachalnik": "judge"}, "looks": {"muzhik": {"add": ["stubble"]}}, "beats": [{"type": "move", "who": "muzhik", "to": "dock"}, {"type": "move", "who": "nachalnik", "to": "judge"}, {"type": "prop", "who": "nachalnik", "item": "gavel", "action": "hold"}, {"type": "act", "who": "nachalnik", "act": "knock"}, {"type": "line", "ref": "l1"}, {"type": "act", "who": "nachalnik", "act": "point"}, {"type": "act", "who": "muzhik", "act": "look-down"}, {"type": "line", "ref": "l2"}, {"type": "act", "who": "muzhik", "act": "stand"}, {"type": "act", "who": "muzhik", "act": "shrug"}, {"type": "line", "ref": "l3"}]}]}
{"id": "ru-9b3a6cdc152e.en", "jokeId": "ru-9b3a6cdc152e", "locale": "en", "adaptation": "direct", "notes": "Line-by-line translation; 500 roubles localised to five hundred dollars per adaptNote. The judge bangs the gavel on the sentence and points at the defendant on the question; the defendant sits in the dock and gets up for his answer.", "title": "The Fine", "location": "sud", "cast": ["muzhik", "nachalnik"], "roles": {"muzhik": "everyman", "nachalnik": "judge"}, "lines": [{"character": "nachalnik", "text": "I sentence you to a fine of five hundred dollars for insulting a public official.", "emotion": "angry", "pauseAfterSec": 0}, {"character": "nachalnik", "text": "Would you like to say anything to that, defendant?", "emotion": "smug", "pauseAfterSec": 0}, {"character": "muzhik", "text": "Actually, I would! But at these prices...", "emotion": "sad", "pauseAfterSec": 0, "laugh": "big"}], "scenes": [{"location": "sud", "cast": ["muzhik", "nachalnik"], "roles": {"muzhik": "everyman", "nachalnik": "judge"}, "looks": {"muzhik": {"add": ["stubble"]}}, "beats": [{"type": "move", "who": "muzhik", "to": "dock"}, {"type": "move", "who": "nachalnik", "to": "judge"}, {"type": "prop", "who": "nachalnik", "item": "gavel", "action": "hold"}, {"type": "act", "who": "nachalnik", "act": "knock"}, {"type": "line", "ref": "l1"}, {"type": "act", "who": "nachalnik", "act": "point"}, {"type": "act", "who": "muzhik", "act": "look-down"}, {"type": "line", "ref": "l2"}, {"type": "act", "who": "muzhik", "act": "stand"}, {"type": "act", "who": "muzhik", "act": "shrug"}, {"type": "line", "ref": "l3"}]}]}
{"id": "ru-9b3a6cdc152e.de", "jokeId": "ru-9b3a6cdc152e", "locale": "de", "adaptation": "direct", "notes": "Line-by-line translation; 500 roubles localised to fünfhundert Euro per adaptNote. The judge bangs the gavel on the sentence and points at the defendant on the question; the defendant sits in the dock and gets up for his answer.", "title": "Die Geldstrafe", "location": "sud", "cast": ["muzhik", "nachalnik"], "roles": {"muzhik": "everyman", "nachalnik": "judge"}, "lines": [{"character": "nachalnik", "text": "Ich verurteile Sie zu einer Geldstrafe von fünfhundert Euro wegen Beleidigung eines Staatsbediensteten.", "emotion": "angry", "pauseAfterSec": 0}, {"character": "nachalnik", "text": "Möchten Sie dazu etwas sagen, Angeklagter?", "emotion": "smug", "pauseAfterSec": 0}, {"character": "muzhik", "text": "Eigentlich schon! Aber bei diesen Preisen...", "emotion": "sad", "pauseAfterSec": 0, "laugh": "big"}], "scenes": [{"location": "sud", "cast": ["muzhik", "nachalnik"], "roles": {"muzhik": "everyman", "nachalnik": "judge"}, "looks": {"muzhik": {"add": ["stubble"]}}, "beats": [{"type": "move", "who": "muzhik", "to": "dock"}, {"type": "move", "who": "nachalnik", "to": "judge"}, {"type": "prop", "who": "nachalnik", "item": "gavel", "action": "hold"}, {"type": "act", "who": "nachalnik", "act": "knock"}, {"type": "line", "ref": "l1"}, {"type": "act", "who": "nachalnik", "act": "point"}, {"type": "act", "who": "muzhik", "act": "look-down"}, {"type": "line", "ref": "l2"}, {"type": "act", "who": "muzhik", "act": "stand"}, {"type": "act", "who": "muzhik", "act": "shrug"}, {"type": "line", "ref": "l3"}]}]}
